%% Container-level sequence: SD-01 Ingest dataset and train model (UC-01, UC-02; FR-01, FR-05, FR-06)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor DS as Data Scientist
  participant ING as Data Ingestion Job<br/>(src/backend/ingest)
  participant UCI as UCI ML Repository
  participant DB as Energy Database<br/>(SQLite)
  participant TRN as ML Training Pipeline<br/>(src/ml)
  participant MS as Model Artifact Store<br/>(models/)

  DS->>ING: python -m src.backend.ingest.loader
  ING->>UCI: GET appliances+energy+prediction.zip
  UCI-->>ING: energydata_complete.csv (19,735 rows)
  ING->>ING: validate schema (29 columns), parse timestamps,<br/>reject duplicates, drop rv1/rv2
  alt schema invalid
    ING-->>DS: error report, nothing written
  else valid
    ING->>DB: bulk INSERT measurements (idempotent on timestamp)
    DB-->>ING: rows inserted
    ING-->>DS: summary (rows, date range)
  end

  DS->>TRN: python -m src.ml.train
  TRN->>DB: SELECT measurements ORDER BY timestamp
  DB-->>TRN: rows
  TRN->>TRN: build features (hour, weekday, weekend, lags)
  TRN->>TRN: chronological split 70 / 15 / 15
  TRN->>TRN: fit baselines + candidate models,<br/>score MAE, RMSE, R2 on validation
  TRN->>TRN: evaluate chosen model once on test set
  TRN->>MS: save energy_model.joblib + metrics.json
  TRN->>DB: INSERT model_runs (version, metrics, artifact path)
  TRN-->>DS: metrics report
